  SceneInitialization: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e4ed4c69e9996274b8d27fddc2d46329,
    type: 2}
  TutorialSteps:
  - ID: 0
    Message: <b><color=#ff6961>Enemies</color></b> are about to attack! Use <b>WASD</b>
      or the directional keys to move the camera
    Events: {fileID: 0}
  - ID: 1
    Message: Hold down the LEFT MOUSE BUTTON to rotate the camera
    Events: {fileID: 0}
  - ID: 9
    Message: LEFT CLICK on the CASTLE to select it
    Events: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a47b9b8056d702440bcb33d00f85dbec, type: 2}
  - ID: 10
    Message: LEFT CLICK on the DEPLOY BUTTON (left bottom) to train a new UNIT
    Events: {fileID: 0}
  - ID: 6
    Message: 'LEFT CLICK on your new  UNIT to show its SPECIALIZATIONS: LEFT CLICK
      on the the LIFTER ICON ...now you have a strong UNIT able to lift TURRETS!'
    Events: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 49cb457e009efd147a19ae2390ed3102, type: 2}
  - ID: 4
    Message: RIGHT CLICK on a TURRET to set it as a destination for your selected
      UNIT. If your UNIT is strong enough, it will lift it!
    Events: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 79cab4e1c80ed1a4e8a7096d6f1659bc, type: 2}
  - ID: 5
    Message: 'While your UNIT is carrying a turret: RIGHT CLICK to set a new destination
      and to drop the TURRET in that point'
    Events: {fileID: 0}
  - ID: 8
    Message: "You are ready! Press the NEXT WAVE banner to start the action! \nRemember:
      in each moment, you can deploy new UNITS, specialize them and TURRETS and give
      them orders"
    Events: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0003d6f8efa78084ca5fcfc6757ff6b0, type: 2}
  - ID: 7
    Message: LEFT CLICK on the PAUSE BUTTON to stop the game action. While in this
      mode, you can still select and upgrade upgrade your UNITS and TURRETS. You can
      set new destinations for your UNITS as well
    Events: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2a355153ed399934f90e161e221ebd48, type: 2}
  - ID: 7
    Message: LEFT CLICK again on the pause button to resume the action
    Events: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2a355153ed399934f90e161e221ebd48, type: 2}
